    description: "Found 2026-10-27 by the INV-nuzas re-check, production `hypergumbo survey` on dev 8c61dbe07c (fixtures in the session scratchpad, nuzas_recheck/py and ctl_flat).\n\nA uv workspace member with a FLAT layout (packages/pkg-c/pyproject.toml beside packages/pkg-c/pkg_c/__init__.py, no src/) is not a Python source root. `_detect_source_roots` (lang-mainstream py.py:2480) collects only directories NAMED `src`, so `_module_name_from_path` (:2541) names the member's files by their repo path: packages/pkg-c/pkg_c/tools.py becomes `packages.pkg-c.pkg_c.tools` (the WI-davan E1 shape the src/ fix removed), and nothing in-tree is named `pkg_c`.\n\nObserved, production code in a sibling member (packages/pkg-a/src/pkg_a/app.py) and in the member itself:\n- `import pkg_c` -> imports `python:pkg_c:0-0:pkg_c:external_symbol` (tier 3)\n- `pkg_c.tools.shout(\"y\")` -> module_attr_ref `python:pkg_c:0-0:pkg_c.tools:external_symbol`\n- `pkg_c.tools.Loud().go()` -> calls `python:pkg_c.tools.Loud:0-0:go:external_symbol`\n- in packages/pkg-c/pkg_c/__init__.py, `from pkg_c import tools` -> imports `python:pkg_c:0-0:tools:external_symbol`\n- `from pkg_c.tools import shout; shout(\"x\")` DOES resolve to the real function (by another route).\nControls: (1) the same package at the repo root (single-package flat layout, ctl_flat) resolves `import pkg_c`, `from pkg_c import tools` and `pkg_c.tools.shout` to the real files and function; (2) the src-layout member pkg-b in the same workspace resolves every shape above. So the defect is the flat-layout MEMBER, and each phantom is consumer-reached with an in-tree definition: an INV-nuzas counterexample.\n\nFix shape: a directory holding a Python project manifest (pyproject.toml / setup.py / setup.cfg) whose child is a package (has __init__.py) is a source root, beside the `src` rule; keep the most-specific-root rule. Check the analogue in every consumer of `_detect_source_roots` (and any other module-name derivation) before fixing one. Measure first on a real flat-layout workspace in the corpus (`find` for packages/*/<pkg>/__init__.py beside packages/*/pyproject.toml), and diff the edge set, not the count. Closure: the fixture above through the production survey, every shape landing on the real node, plus the root-level control unchanged."  # fa8d
    fields: {}  # fa8d
